    "description": "Move a placed item (items[].id from describe_room) to a new plan position, optionally with a new rotation, height, room or placement relation. Omitted fields stay as they are; roomId and relation accept null to clear. Refused with placement_invalid when the new spot is outside the room, over a wall or another item, or in a door swing, and with precondition_failed for a locked item (existing furniture such as a built-in wardrobe; only the user may move it). Call validate_layout afterwards to check windows and walkways. Undo moves it back. To find a valid spot first, call get_placement_options.",
